<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Lie"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538283046"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">杂乱不堪的房间 各自独坐的沙发</text><text for="L2">蜷缩着低头看手机的你</text><text for="L3">电视里回荡着刻意的笑声</text><text for="L4">我可不是仅仅为了想见你才来的</text><text for="L5">上周日 你到底在哪里？ <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(你在哪？)</span></text><text for="L6">强忍着泪水 发颤的声音 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(颤声)</span></text><text for="L7">你却那么理所当然 提起陌生女孩的名字</text><text for="L8">怎么能当着我的面 说得出口？</text><text for="L9">明明信任你 你却一再说谎</text><text for="L10">明明深爱着你 我却哭个不停</text><text for="L11">卑微纠缠 哀求着不要离开</text><text for="L12">事到如今 我才不想说出口</text><text for="L13">再见</text><text for="L14">我也不懂为何</text><text for="L15">明明想要忘记 却还是翻开那个女孩的社交主页</text><text for="L16">忍不住到处翻找的自己 让我嫌恶透顶</text><text for="L17">看着相视欢笑那么幸福的两个人</text><text for="L18">依稀就是当初让我心动时的你</text><text for="L19">最近我们彼此 早就习以为常 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(习以为常)</span></text><text for="L20">相互背叛的事 也做过太多 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(屡屡如此)</span></text><text for="L21">就算最初的那份悸动早已不在</text><text for="L22">我曾那样喜欢你 其实直到现在也依然如此</text><text for="L23">明明那么相信你 你却满口谎言 你在说谎</text><text for="L24">明明那么深爱你 我却泣不成声 我在痛哭</text><text for="L25">紧紧缠着你 说着别离开之类的话</text><text for="L26">事到如今 我不想再去挽留</text><text for="L27">只能说再见</text><text for="L28">我至今也不明白为何</text><text for="L29">从刚在一起时 满溢着“好喜欢你”的聊天记录</text><text for="L30">一周年 两周年的纪念日 一层层堆起的回忆</text><text for="L31">本以为相处得越久 就会爱得越深</text><text for="L32">究竟从何时开始 我成了多余的存在呢？</text><text for="L33">明明那么信任你 你却满口谎言 你在撒谎 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(谎言连篇)</span></text><text for="L34">明明那么深爱你 我却泪流不止 我在痛哭 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(泪如雨下)</span></text><text for="L35">紧紧缠着你 说着别离开之类的话</text><text for="L36">事到如今 我再也不想说出口</text><text for="L37">就此再见</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:56.086"><div begin="0:09.935" end="2:56.086"><p begin="0:09.935" end="0:14.185" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:09.935" end="0:10.055">ぐ</span><span begin="0:10.055" end="0:10.415">ちゃ</span><span begin="0:10.415" end="0:10.525">ぐ</span><span begin="0:10.525" end="0:10.925">ちゃ</span><span begin="0:10.925" end="0:11.295">の</span><span begin="0:11.295" end="0:11.585">部</span><span begin="0:11.585" end="0:11.845">屋</span> <span begin="0:12.255" end="0:12.705">別</span><span begin="0:12.705" end="0:13.205">々</span><span begin="0:13.205" end="0:13.475">の</span><span begin="0:13.475" end="0:13.745">ソ</span><span begin="0:13.745" end="0:14.185">ファ</span></p><p begin="0:14.565" end="0:18.715" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.565" end="0:14.955">丸</span><span begin="0:14.955" end="0:15.465">まっ</span><span begin="0:15.465" end="0:15.805">て</span><span begin="0:15.805" end="0:16.335">携</span><span begin="0:16.335" end="0:16.695">帯</span><span begin="0:16.695" end="0:16.885">見</span><span begin="0:16.885" end="0:17.275">て</span><span begin="0:17.275" end="0:17.435">る</span><span begin="0:17.595" end="0:17.855">あ</span><span begin="0:17.855" end="0:18.295">な</span><span begin="0:18.295" end="0:18.715">た</span></p><p begin="0:19.103" end="0:23.353" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.103" end="0:19.513">わざ</span><span begin="0:19.513" end="0:19.733">と</span><span begin="0:19.733" end="0:19.913">ら</span><span begin="0:19.913" end="0:20.083">し</span><span begin="0:20.083" end="0:20.393">く</span><span begin="0:20.393" end="0:20.973">笑う</span> <span begin="0:21.333" end="0:21.503">テ</span><span begin="0:21.503" end="0:21.823">レ</span><span begin="0:21.823" end="0:21.983">ビ</span><span begin="0:21.983" end="0:22.313">が</span><span begin="0:22.313" end="0:22.903">響</span><span begin="0:22.903" end="0:23.353">く</span></p><p begin="0:23.673" end="0:27.693" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.673" end="0:23.793">た</span><span begin="0:23.793" end="0:24.143">だ</span><span begin="0:24.143" end="0:24.303">会</span><span begin="0:24.303" end="0:24.563">い</span><span begin="0:24.563" end="0:24.953">た</span><span begin="0:24.953" end="0:25.233">く</span><span begin="0:25.233" end="0:25.473">て</span><span begin="0:25.473" end="0:25.773">来</span><span begin="0:25.773" end="0:26.083">た</span><span begin="0:26.083" end="0:26.323">わ</span><span begin="0:26.323" end="0:26.573">け</span><span begin="0:26.573" end="0:27.003">じゃ</span><span begin="0:27.003" end="0:27.693">ない</span></p><p begin="0:27.694" end="0:31.644" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.694" end="0:28.164">先</span><span begin="0:28.164" end="0:28.474">週</span><span begin="0:28.694" end="0:29.404">日</span><span begin="0:29.404" end="0:29.814">曜</span> <span begin="0:29.814" end="0:30.014">ど</span><span begin="0:30.014" end="0:30.554">こ</span><span begin="0:30.554" end="0:31.004">に</span><span begin="0:31.004" end="0:31.154">い</span><span begin="0:31.154" end="0:31.644">た？</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:31.666" end="0:32.208">(いた)</span></span></p><p begin="0:32.400" end="0:36.460" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.400" end="0:33.000">涙</span><span begin="0:33.230" end="0:33.760">堪</span><span begin="0:33.760" end="0:33.890">え</span><span begin="0:33.890" end="0:34.340">て</span> <span begin="0:34.340" end="0:35.010">震</span><span begin="0:35.010" end="0:35.140">え</span><span begin="0:35.140" end="0:35.450">る</span><span begin="0:35.450" end="0:36.460">声</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:36.201" end="0:36.761">(声)</span></span></p><p begin="0:36.953" end="0:41.443" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.953" end="0:37.323">当</span><span begin="0:37.323" end="0:37.753">然</span><span begin="0:37.803" end="0:38.053">の</span><span begin="0:38.053" end="0:38.523">よう</span><span begin="0:38.523" end="0:38.693">に</span> <span begin="0:38.863" end="0:39.183">知</span><span begin="0:39.183" end="0:39.513">ら</span><span begin="0:39.513" end="0:39.713">な</span><span begin="0:39.713" end="0:40.043">い</span><span begin="0:40.043" end="0:40.313">子</span><span begin="0:40.313" end="0:40.673">の</span><span begin="0:40.673" end="0:40.893">名</span><span begin="0:40.893" end="0:41.443">前</span></p><p begin="0:41.445" end="0:46.015" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.445" end="0:41.865">どう</span><span begin="0:41.865" end="0:42.275">し</span><span begin="0:42.275" end="0:42.615">て</span><span begin="0:42.615" end="0:43.825">私</span><span begin="0:43.825" end="0:44.365">に</span> <span begin="0:44.695" end="0:44.995">言</span><span begin="0:44.995" end="0:45.525">える</span><span begin="0:45.525" end="0:46.015">の？</span></p><p begin="0:46.003" end="0:50.423" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.003" end="0:46.543">信</span><span begin="0:46.543" end="0:46.923">じ</span><span begin="0:46.923" end="0:47.153">て</span><span begin="0:47.153" end="0:47.653">た</span><span begin="0:47.653" end="0:48.083">の</span><span begin="0:48.083" end="0:48.983">に</span> <span begin="0:49.243" end="0:49.533">You</span> <span begin="0:49.533" end="0:49.823">lie,</span> <span begin="0:49.823" end="0:50.083">you</span> <span begin="0:50.083" end="0: