know</span> <span begin="1:08.668" end="1:11.158">why</span></p><p begin="1:13.948" end="1:18.168" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.948" end="1:14.408">忘</span><span begin="1:14.408" end="1:14.518">れ</span><span begin="1:14.518" end="1:15.008">た</span><span begin="1:15.008" end="1:15.148">い</span><span begin="1:15.148" end="1:15.518">の</span><span begin="1:15.518" end="1:15.808">に</span> <span begin="1:16.278" end="1:16.638">あの</span><span begin="1:16.638" end="1:16.798">子</span><span begin="1:16.798" end="1:17.208">の</span><span begin="1:17.278" end="1:17.488">イン</span><span begin="1:17.488" end="1:17.748">ス</span><span begin="1:17.748" end="1:18.168">タ</span></p><p begin="1:18.492" end="1:22.792" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.492" end="1:18.952">探</span><span begin="1:18.952" end="1:19.102">し</span><span begin="1:19.102" end="1:19.442">て</span><span begin="1:19.442" end="1:19.702">し</span><span begin="1:19.702" end="1:20.082">まう</span> <span begin="1:20.082" end="1:20.282">自</span><span begin="1:20.282" end="1:20.702">分</span><span begin="1:20.702" end="1:20.982">に</span><span begin="1:20.982" end="1:21.442">嫌</span><span begin="1:21.442" end="1:21.922">気</span><span begin="1:21.922" end="1:22.282">が</span><span begin="1:22.282" end="1:22.592">差</span><span begin="1:22.592" end="1:22.792">す</span></p><p begin="1:23.023" end="1:27.293" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.023" end="1:23.623">幸</span><span begin="1:23.623" end="1:24.023">せ</span><span begin="1:24.023" end="1:24.663">そう</span><span begin="1:24.663" end="1:24.943">に</span> <span begin="1:25.343" end="1:25.743">笑</span><span begin="1:25.743" end="1:25.843">い</span><span begin="1:25.843" end="1:26.023">合</span><span begin="1:26.023" end="1:26.293">う</span><span begin="1:26.293" end="1:26.973">二</span><span begin="1:26.973" end="1:27.293">人</span></p><p begin="1:27.660" end="1:31.780" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.660" end="1:27.820">好